    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ordal">Ord</ref> 4.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">and ne sy þær nan oðer spǽc inne, buton þæt hig biddan God Ælmihtig georne, þæt he soðeste geswytelie.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">and no other words shall be spoken in the church, except that God be earnestly prayed to make clear the whole truth.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 ne sy þær nan oðer spǽc inne, buton þæt hig biddan God ælmihtig georne, þæt he þæt soðeste geswytelie.</ab>
      </div>
